Note on the demo dataset

All merchant, customer, transaction, review, competitor and market-signal data
in this repository is synthetically generated and entirely fictional. It is
produced by the deterministic generator in backend/app/seed/ and does not
represent any real business, person or transaction.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to One97
Communications Limited or Paypal. It contains no integration with live Paypal
systems, no real payment execution, and no real customer messaging.
